{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the beginning of <i>Tetherfall</i>, where a father\u2019s desperate search for his missing daughter leads him into a nightmare beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, experience the unsettling first moments of the game\u2014where reality begins to unravel. Explore eerie, liminal spaces filled with shifting environments and creeping dread. Shadows move when you're not looking, whispers echo from unseen sources, and the world itself seems to distort around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel cryptic clues, navigate the unknown, and face the creeping realization that something <i>else</i> is watching. The choices you make now may set the course for what\u2019s to come\u2014but are you ready for the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you hold onto reality, or will you fall deeper into the nightmare? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214060?t=1745958772","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214060/77698503eec34fda75f55e9a888181831bddfc75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745958772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214060/5b954a83744ceabe912e69a9ed3ba29893fcf784/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745958772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214060/5b954a83744ceabe912e69a9ed3ba29893fcf784/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745958772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content,  Frequent Violence or Gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the beginning of <i>Tetherfall</i>, where a father\u2019s desperate search for his missing daughter le